WEBVTT

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:11.722
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Here are ten top tips to make your car trip safe.

00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:14.241
Tip one

00:00:14.722 --> 00:00:16.332
Plan your trip.

00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:22.142
Look at a map and plan where to stop on the way.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.230
Tip two

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:32.205
Check your car.

00:00:35.195 --> 00:00:37.676
Is it ready for a long trip?

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:43.180
Do it yourself or take it to a garage.

00:00:59.695 --> 00:01:00.993
Tip three

00:01:01.712 --> 00:01:05.784
Listen to traffic information on the radio,

00:01:08.085 --> 00:01:12.882
or check on the internet, before you start your trip.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.787
Tip four

00:01:27.551 --> 00:01:30.713
Take a map with you in the car,

00:01:31.401 --> 00:01:34.604
or have a map app on your phone –

00:01:39.127 --> 00:01:42.080
GPS isn’t always right.

00:01:57.646 --> 00:01:58.810
Tip five

00:01:59.525 --> 00:02:01.453
Take bottles of water.

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:09.670
People are often thirsty on long car trips.

00:02:21.259 --> 00:02:22.406
Tip six

00:02:28.988 --> 00:02:31.527
If you have children in the car,

00:02:31.808 --> 00:02:35.860
take books, games, and tablets with you.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.816
Then the children can watch videos or read.

00:02:42.781 --> 00:02:47.660
When children are quiet, the driver is less distracted.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:52.450
Tip seven

00:02:56.513 --> 00:03:02.329
Check that all the passengers in the car have their seat belts on.

00:03:13.838 --> 00:03:14.721
Tip eight

00:03:15.781 --> 00:03:18.227
Check that you have gas.

00:03:21.915 --> 00:03:29.337
Don’t wait until your gas tank is nearly empty before you look for a gas station.

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:42.425
Tip nine

00:03:43.877 --> 00:03:49.096
After driving for two hours, stop for fifteen minutes.

00:03:52.255 --> 00:03:55.396
Have a snack, and get some fresh air.

00:04:01.372 --> 00:04:07.446
If you’re very tired, have a coffee or a drink with caffeine.

00:04:08.808 --> 00:04:12.323
Finally, tip ten.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:17.280
This is very, very important.

00:04:20.866 --> 00:04:23.108
Don’t use your phone.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:31.725
Calling and texting are very dangerous because you don’t concentrate on the road.

00:04:42.108 --> 00:04:43.468
Have a safe trip!